      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "\"Stepping out of the loop\" doesn't mean ignoring the problem; it means finding a way to stop letting the *feeling* of the problem consume you entirely. This is a heavy, permanent weight, and you don't have to carry it all on your own right now. If the path forward is blocked, sometimes the only escape is to find a different kind of immediate relief, a small pocket of peace that doesn't involve the system. Please consider reaching out to someone who can offer immediate, real support.",
